      "num_turns": 32,
      "result": "Implemented the persistent URL shortener in `/workspace`. `sh start.sh` applies pending migrations and serves the API on `0.0.0.0:8000`.\n\nHTTP checks covered creation with a generated code, duplicate custom codes (409), invalid codes and URLs (422), malformed JSON (422), lookup, listing, missing codes (404), and redirects (302) with the click count incrementing once. The PostgreSQL migration ran successfully, and the data remained in the database. The server is left running on port 8000.\n\n`git diff --check` and `sh -n start.sh` passed. The Rails test command has no tests yet and hit an environment mismatch because the test configuration points at the same `DATABASE_URL` database marked as development.",
